<%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main>
        <div class="container py-4">
            <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-body-emphasis text-center pb-4">My Projects</h1>
            <div class="row align-items-md-stretch">
                <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                    <div class="h-100 shadow p-5 bg-white text-dark rounded-3">
                        <h2>CLI Weather App</h2>
                        <p>Displays weather information based on user input. User can either use current location or select any location
                            in the world. Built using Python.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                    <div class="h-100 shadow p-5 bg-white text-dark rounded-3">
                        <h2>Cybersecurity Lab</h2>
                        <p>Virtualized network designed to study simulated attack strategies and defense mechanisms. Uses Caldera to
                            attack and Wazuh to collect logs.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row align-items-md-stretch">
                <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                    <div class="h-100 shadow p-5 bg-white text-dark rounded-3">
                        <h2>CLI Banking Simulation</h2>
                        <p>A simulation of customer management within a bank. Users can add new customers and update account information
                            of current customers. Built using Python.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                    <div class="h-100 shadow p-5 bg-white text-dark rounded-3">
                        <h2>CLI Library Simulation</h2>
                        <p>Users can design they're own library and simulate the actions of a library. They can track books available
                            and manage customer accounts. Built using Python.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
